"Verify observables: `observable_weight_l2` (global) and "
"`observable_gradient_norm` (normalized) are registered in the Trainer's "
"observables panel."
msgstr ""
"确认 Trainer 的 observables 面板中已注册 `observable_weight_l2`（全局）"
"和 `observable_gradient_norm`（已归一化）。"

